---
import WikiLayout from '../../layouts/WikiLayout.astro';
import DevlogNav from '../../components/DevlogNav.astro';
---
<WikiLayout
  title="Below Deck — May 2026"
  section="devlog"
  description="Demo post-mortem: 320+ players, 700+ wishlists gained, and a look at what's coming next for Davy Jones' Deckhand."
  ogImage="/images/devlog/may-2026/thumbnail.png"
>
  <div class="wiki-content devlog-entry">

    <div class="entry-meta">
      <a href="/devlog" class="back-link">← All Devlogs</a>
      <span class="entry-date">May 2026</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Davy Jones' Deckhand demo post-mortem 🏴‍☠️</h1>

    <p>Ahoy crew, welcome below deck!</p>
    <p>My lovely wife shared this image with me a few days ago as I was wrapping up the final touches on a huge funding application, the last huge task in a huge month of deadlines and crunch. It was a good hint. I was getting right towards the far edge of "Strain", productivity starting to decline. When I hit submit, suddenly my throat hurt. I'm off sick now.</p>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/intro.jpg" alt="" class="devlog-img" />

    <p>So I'm taking it a little easy this week. I do still want to update you all on how things have been going with the demo launch.</p>

    <h2>Demo launch post-mortem</h2>

    <div class="info-block">
      <p class="info-label">Key demo stats:</p>
      <p><strong>Players:</strong> 320+</p>
      <p><strong>Median playtime:</strong> 43 minutes (1hr 43m average)</p>
      <p><strong>Wishlists gained:</strong> 700+</p>
      <p><strong>ANZ Indie Showcase:</strong> <a href="https://youtu.be/IihLc4hUboY?si=UbzKUislSqFuA3vy&t=1229" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the VOD</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4538750/Davy_Jones_Deckhand_Demo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Play the demo here</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="video-wrap">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/IihLc4hUboY?start=1229" title="ANZ Indie Showcase — Davy Jones' Deckhand" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>

    <h3>Weapon stats</h3>
    <p>The saber seemed to be the most consistent winner. Broken Mop was chosen less and seemed to also be the toughest to win with. The Broken Mop can be a great time if you can get a good infinite loop and healing engine going!</p>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/weapon-stats.png" alt="Weapon stats chart" class="devlog-img" />

    <h3>Wins/loss ratio for each voyage attempt number</h3>
    <p>Who beat the massive crab during their tutorial voyage (Attempt 1)!?! Apparently there were three of you!</p>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/voyage-attempts.png" alt="Wins and losses by voyage attempt number" class="devlog-img" />

    <h3>Most lethal enemies</h3>
    <p>The Giant Enemy Crab wins for murdering the most players overall. But the winner for most player kills per fight (mean per event) goes to Thessaly the Sea Witch.</p>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/lethal-enemies-1.png" alt="Most lethal enemies by total kills" class="devlog-img" />
    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/lethal-enemies-2.png" alt="Most lethal enemies by mean kills per fight" class="devlog-img" />

    <h3>Crab stats</h3>
    <p>How many crabs did you collectively butcher, and how many times did they kill you back? It's 1,100 kills to the players and just 255 to team crab. Looks like you ratioed them pretty hard.</p>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/crab-stats.png" alt="Crab kill stats" class="devlog-img" />

    <h3>Favourite card pick</h3>
    <p><a href="/cards/attack/find-the-gap-10"><strong>Find the Gap</strong></a> was your favourite card to pick. This was not a big surprise as there has been a lot of feedback about how overpowered that card is. This has been noted and will be addressed in updates. We are hoping that the mid-voyage card upgrades and a better rarity system will help to balance issues like this in future updates.</p>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/card-pick.png" alt="Favourite card pick: Find the Gap" class="devlog-img" />

    <h2>Wishlist milestone: Thanks for 2,000!</h2>

    <img src="/images/devlog/may-2026/wishlist-2000.png" alt="2000 wishlists milestone" class="devlog-img" />

    <p>We blew past the 2,000 wishlists milestone during the Deckbuilders Fest and are on track for 2,500 in June. It has certainly not been easy getting here but it feels like things are picking up a little momentum. We're now at about 10% of our minimum launch wishlist target, so I still need you to tell your grandmas to smash that wishlist button and convert on launch day. Please and thank you!</p>

    <h2>What next?</h2>

    <p>Davy Jones' Deckhand will be in the <strong>Frosty Games Fest</strong> Steam sale in June, but not the showcase this year. We'll also be in <strong>Strategems</strong> later this month, and we're currently in the <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/category/ocean" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Steam Ocean Fest</strong></a> which you can check out now.</p>

    <p><strong>We're working on:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Demo patch with quick wins based on early feedback</li>
      <li>Seeded RNG improvements</li>
      <li>Currency/mid-voyage merchants</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Until next time me hearties, yo ho!<br /><br />Ben and the Cass Bay Games Team</p>

    <DevlogNav currentSlug="may-2026" />

  </div>
</WikiLayout>

<style>
  .devlog-entry {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--ocean);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--gold-dark);
  }

  .entry-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .devlog-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .info-block {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .info-block p {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: rgba(185, 216, 227, 0.9);
  }

  .info-label {
    color: var(--off-white) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  .info-block a {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .video-wrap {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
    height: 0;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .video-wrap iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  li a {
    color: var(--gold);
  }
</style>
